 "notes": "Added makers to maker-less models: ERGO-Lux MP and OKOLUX Plus to Schweizer, Mobilux LED to Eschenbach. Dropped 'Mobilent' because no retrieved page confirmed its maker. Dropped Ocutech VES-Falcon, Reveal InstaMount and through-the-lens SKUs; Reveal kept as a range. Added the Braille device kind with the Perkins Brailler archetype and Brailliant, Focus 40 Blue and BrailleNote evolve. Added the Hoover long cane archetype under White cane, with Ambutech and Awarewolf Gear versions taken from the RNIB long-canes page. RNIB is a retailer, not a cane maker, so it gets no brand entry. Left out: Optelec Compact 6 HD and ClearView, and Freedom Scientific Topaz/Ruby, because their pages could not be fetched; brand entries for Ocutech and Awarewolf Gear; traditions, since none apply."
